     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><font color=\"#660066\"><span style=\"color:#000\">p </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> layout </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;circular&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">length </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;none&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><div>tp &lt;- p + geom_tiplab2(aes(color = label %in% to_drop), size=3, hjust = -.1) + scale_color_manual(values = c(&quot;seagreen&quot;, &quot;red&quot;))+xlim(NA, 18)+geom_hilight(node = 191, fill = &quot;steelblue&quot;,alpha = 0.6)</div><div>print(tp)</div></span></font><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div>after I run the code，there‘s a error.<p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/369c0b4ec9ef3/WX2...@2x.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"WX2...@2x.png\" width=\"320\" height=\"98\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><div>Dr.Yu, could you give me some advice?</div></div>"
