     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/3c5943b50d6be/Rplot.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Rplot.png\" width=\"217\" height=\"320\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\"></p><br>Thanks, it works today. But，I don&#39;t know what happened yesterday.<div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><div>#读取nwk树</div><div>tree &lt;- read.newick(&quot;sl_at_aaefamily.nwk&quot;)</div><div>#可视化树</div><div>p1 &lt;- ggtree(tree, layout = &quot;circular&quot;, branch.length = &quot;none&quot;)</div><div>#打印进化树</div><div>print(p1)</div><div>#着重显示部分进化树</div><div>p2 &lt;- p1 + geom_hilight(node = 191, fill = &quot;steelblue&quot;)</div><div>#打印进化树</div><div>print(p2)</div></span></div></code></div></div></div>"
